A second 68-group vendor solved, so this rung will escalate. This exposes a real design issue: simply lengthening the partition would exceed the intended-route cap. I’m letting the run complete, then I’ll use the recorded solution methods to harden the structure at fixed answer length rather than counting transcription as difficulty.
