The fixed-size redesign now passes all local gates except the oracle-dependent G9 field. At hard it uses 240 answer atoms/1,011 characters, 240 intended operations, 0/200,000 structured guesses, and the honest reference solver takes 96,000 measured operations. I’m restarting the bare harness from a clean transcript.
