Rejected on Track B hardness gate G9(b).

The native BusOut construction based on Section 2 and Theorem 2 is generatable and exactly verifiable, and G1–G8 passed. However:

- Bare oracle run at `n=82`: 0/3 solved.
- Structural-hint run: 2/3 solved.
- Mechanical route: 100,860 operations.
- Compact modular route: 246 operations.
- Answer: 246 atoms, 1,039 characters.

Thus naming the intended invariant makes the family tractable in context. Per the one-escalation rule, it cannot ship. The relevant paper regime is one spot, two colors, unit capacities, and disjoint directed paths. [Full paper](https://arxiv.org/html/2505.09165v1)

